description: Vue component patterns for Cartonium UI
globs: app/components/**/*.vue
alwaysApply: false
---

# Components

- Place by domain: `app/components/pages/<feature>/`, shared under `app/components/common/` or root `app/components/`.
- Props: typed with interfaces; emit events for parent-owned mutations (see gathering `table-item.vue` → parent `guestSet`).
- UI: Vuetify (`v-btn`, `v-card`, …) + Vuetify utility classes. Themes from `vuetify.config.ts`.
- Prefer scoped `<style>`; avoid new global CSS.
- Do not expand `table-item.vue` further with more duplicated view templates — extract only if explicitly asked.
- i18n: use `$t` when the surrounding feature already does; do not leave new user-facing English/Russian mixed inconsistently within one PR without reason.
